        "id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u01",
        "text": "最近有不少外国人来{展示地名}工作和旅游，街区也有了一些新变化。大家怎么看？",
        "display_time": "今天 10:30",
        "source": "微博网页版",
        "initial_likes": 128,
        "media": [
          {
            "src": "assets/shanghai-street.jpg",
            "alt": "上海街边的梧桐树和停放的共享单车"
          }
        ],
        "age_minutes": 60
      }
    ],
    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "c01",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u02",
        "text": "我不太赞成更多外国人搬来这里，总觉得会带来麻烦。",
        "initial_likes": 36,
        "research_role": "exclusionary_placeholder",
        "relative_time_minutes": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "c02",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u04",
        "text": "你说的麻烦具体是什么？",
        "initial_likes": 8,
        "research_role": "neutral",
        "relative_time_minutes": 4
      },
      {
        "id": "c03",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u02",
        "text": "主要还是不熟悉，担心生活习惯合不来。",
        "initial_likes": 12,
        "research_role": "concern",
        "relative_time_minutes": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "c04",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u03",
        "text": "生活习惯不同的情况可以具体讨论。",
        "initial_likes": 5,
        "research_role": "neutral",
        "relative_time_minutes": 8
      },
      {
        "id": "c05",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u04",
        "text": "附近确实新开了几家店。",
        "initial_likes": 9,
        "research_role": "neutral",
        "relative_time_minutes": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "c06",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u02",
        "text": "我还是觉得应该少让外国人来，省得出现问题。",
        "initial_likes": 24,
        "research_role": "exclusionary_placeholder",
        "relative_time_minutes": 12
      },
      {
        "id": "c07",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u05",
        "text": "担心社区变化可以理解，但仅凭外国人身份就排斥所有人，对认真工作和遵守规则的人并不公平。遇到具体问题，按同样的规则处理会更合适。",
        "initial_likes": 18,
        "research_role": "counter_speech",
        "relative_time_minutes": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "c08",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u03",
        "text": "可以先说清楚大家遇到了哪些具体情况。",
        "initial_likes": 6,
        "research_role": "neutral",
        "relative_time_minutes": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "c09",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u04",
        "text": "想看看住在附近的人怎么说。",
        "initial_likes": 4,
        "research_role": "neutral",
        "relative_time_minutes": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "c10",
        "post_id": "p01",
        "author_id": "u03",
        "text": "社区信息如果能更清楚一些就好了。",
        "initial_likes": 7,
        "research_role": "neutral",
        "relative_time_minutes": 20
      }
    ],
    "material_status": "所有文本仅用于讨论界面和树结构，未经正式刺激材料预测试。"
